			"url": "https://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/12763",
			"summary": "A core contributor proposes a `permissions` section in `deno.jsonc` mirroring the CLI flags, overriding command-line flags with a warning, resolving paths relative to the config, and prompting for remote configs, with open questions on remote and non-TTY behaviour.",
			"actorId": 1282577,
			"actorType": "human"
		},
		{
			"id": "deno-12763:comment:968392451",
			"kind": "comment",
			"actor": "crowlKats",
			"createdAt": "2021-11-14T23:47:47Z",
			"editedAt": "2021-11-14T23:50:42Z",
			"url": "https://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/12763#issuecomment-968392451",
			"summary": "A maintainer wants `permissions: true` for allow-all, opposes block keys that would have no flag equivalent, and wants list values only as arrays.",
			"actorId": 13135287,
			"actorType": "human",
			"parentId": "deno-12763:issue:12763"
		},
		{
			"id": "deno-12763:comment:968392727",
			"kind": "comment",
			"actor": "bartlomieju",
			"createdAt": "2021-11-14T23:49:45Z",
			"url": "https://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/12763#issuecomment-968392727",
			"summary": "A maintainer supports the idea, especially with tasks, but doubts a single top-level permission set suits projects with several entry points, and wants the shape to follow the test and worker permission objects.",
			"actorId": 13602871,
			"actorType": "human",
			"parentId": "deno-12763:issue:12763"
		},
		{
			"id": "deno-12763:comment:968396128",
			"kind": "comment",
			"actor": "kitsonk",
			"createdAt": "2021-11-15T00:07:15Z",
			"url": "https://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/12763#issuecomment-968396128",
			"summary": "The opener replies that the config has no notion of entry points yet, so a top-level default set is the logical start, and the key point is not to flatten permissions into separate top-level keys.",
			"actorId": 1282577,
			"actorType": "human",
			"parentId": "deno-12763:issue:12763"
		},
		{
			"id": "deno-12763:comment:968396516",
			"kind": "comment",
			"actor": "kitsonk",
			"createdAt": "2021-11-15T00:08:43Z",
			"url": "https://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/12763#issuecomment-968396516",
			"summary": "The opener notes the config can already express things the CLI cannot, citing compiler options.",
			"actorId": 1282577,
			"actorType": "human",
			"parentId": "deno-12763:issue:12763"
		},
		{
			"id": "deno-12763:comment:968397158",
			"kind": "comment",
			"actor": "kitsonk",
			"createdAt": "2021-11-15T00:10:53Z",
			"url": "https://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/12763#issuecomment-968397158",
			"summary": "The opener agrees to follow the test and worker permission object shape.",
			"actorId": 1282577,
			"actorType": "human",
			"parentId": "deno-12763:issue:12763"
		},
		{
			"id": "deno-12763:comment:968398270",
